## Relationship with 04-project

`docs/04-project/ARCHITECTURE.md` records the **structural map of the
working tree** for AI-agent consumption. The files here are the
**audience-facing technical narrative** for developers.

| Concern | Lives at |
|---|---|
| Layer roles + dependency directions for agent enforcement | `ARCHITECTURE.md` (repo root) |
| Long-form architecture explanation for developers | `03-technical/architecture/overview.md` |
| Forbidden patterns enforced at review | `CONSTRAINTS.md` (repo root) |
| API contract narrative for integrators | `03-technical/reference/api-reference.md` |
| ADRs | `03-technical/architecture/decisions/` (link target) and `docs/04-project/decisions/` (source) |

## How this folder grows

A Product Delta with target `03-technical/*` is proposed at:
- Feature close stage when architecture, contract, or config changed
- Concept Publish stage for cross-feature technical rules
- ADR acceptance

End-user how-to stays in 01-product. Business rules stay in 02-business.
Implementation narrative for developers lives here.
